~ start
do! MusicManager._fade_out()
Fenn: [color="8A0194"]Wizard[/color]?
Wizard: [font_size=100][shake level=10 rate=50]BY POSTLY HEAVEN![/shake][/font_size]
Fenn: It's me! Fenn?
Wizard awkward: Oh. Pint-size...
Fenn: [font_size=60]I'm ready for you, [color="8A0194"]Wizard Man[/color]! [wave freq=7 amp=30][i]I WILL defeat you![/i][/wave][/font_size]
Wizard awkward: Oh! Um,[wait=0.3] [font_size=40]well, [/font_size][wait=0.3][font_size=30]you see...[/font_size]
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.4")
Wizard: [font_size=40]My tools art in thy workshop... I was, um,[wait=0.3] out looking for something, and, well-[/font_size]
Az: [font_size=70]WAIT-[wait=0.3] are you [/font_size][font_size=80][shake level=8 rate=40][i]LOST?![/i][/shake][/font_size]
Wizard grit: [font_size=70]No![wait=0.3] [i]NO![/i][wait=0.3] I'm not [i]lost![/i][/font_size][wait=0.3][wait=0.3] I knoweth my way out of here [i]perfectly fine![/i]
Wizard awkward: [font_size=40]Or... I did.[/font_size]
Az laugh: [font_size=100]HAHA![wait=0.3] This is GREAT![/font_size]
Az laugh: [font_size=60]Boy you really [i]ARE[/i] pathetic. How in postly heaven did you even capture [i]the Knights?[/i]
Wizard grit: [font_size=100]UGH! [wait=0.3][shake level=10 rate=50]SHUTTETH UP!![/shake][/font_size]
Wizard awkward: [font_size=30]Hey, pint-size... wh- [wait=0.3]whereth be thine exit?[/font_size]
Fenn: Oh! [wait=0.3]It's just behind you. I see it there.
Wizard awkward: Oh... thanks.
Fenn starry: [wave freq=7 amp=20]No problem! Happy to help.[/wave]
Wizard leaves
Az: Did- [wait=0.3]did you just let him get away?
Fenn: [font_size=70]OH WAIT!! COME BACK![/font_size]
Wizard: [font_size=70]UM. [wave freq=10 amp=20]LALALA I CAN'T HEARETH YOU![/wave][/font_size]
Az: [font_size=40][i]Oh by Post.[/i] They're both idiots.[/font_size]
do! MusicManager._fade_in()
do EventFlags.set_flag("7-Ws-Lost-HeaterArea", true)
=> END